---
title: Chicken and Waffles
description: Crisp buttermilk chicken on waffles, with hot honey.
servings: 4
course: dinner
prep time: 20 min
cook time: 30 min
tags: [comfort, weekend]
---
= Chicken

Soak @chicken thighs{8} in @buttermilk{300%ml} with @paprika{1%tsp} for ~{20%minutes}.

Toss them in @flour{150%g} and fry in @vegetable oil{500%ml} in a #deep pan{} for ~{12%minutes}, turning once.

= Waffles

Make @waffles{4} in a #waffle iron{} while the chicken rests.

= Serve

Put the chicken on the waffles and drizzle [[Hot Honey]]{3} over.
